  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_hanger_2_cb577122ec60497ed7d0b56830f16026a53ea12a5890ebcd1a4cb1a01702ef3a72">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Swords with relatively short, pointed, single-edged, curved or straight blades designed primarily for cutting. They served as all-purpose weapons, used by civilians, hunters, sailors, and infantry soldiers, from the 16th to the 19th century. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
